  "description": "The package simplifies the implementation of secure user authentication in web applications by handling HTTP requests, token management, and encryption. \n        It offers a clean and intuitive interface for interacting with authentication endpoints, abstracting away the complexity of low-level implementation details. \n        The package includes built-in support for secure communication and centralized error handling, making it easy to integrate authentication functionality into your .NET projects.\n        In the future, it is planned to add additional general-purpose classes and interfaces to enhance functionality.",
